category: Libs
requires: cygwin libcairo2 libgdk_pixbuf2.0_0 libgerbv1 libglib2.0_0 libgtk2.0_0 libintl8
sdesc: "Gerber (RS-274X) viewer (utilities)"
ldesc: "Gerbv is an open source Gerber file (RS-274X only) viewer. Gerbv lets you load
several files on top of each other, do measurements on the displayed image,
etc. Besides viewing Gerbers, you may also view Excellon drill files as well
as pick-place file"

